WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.560
Learn two useful shortcuts for your desktop
keyboard.

00:00:05.432 --> 00:00:07.982
First, click outside any text input.

00:00:08.932 --> 00:00:11.902
Press question mark to open Keyboard
Shortcuts.

00:00:12.765 --> 00:00:17.155
Start with A for Aria, and P for Portfolio.

00:00:18.015 --> 00:00:21.485
Close help with Escape, then press A.

00:00:22.348 --> 00:00:26.058
Pause, then press P to open Portfolio.

00:00:26.932 --> 00:00:30.302
On a phone, use the visible tabs instead.

00:00:31.182 --> 00:00:34.112
Practise these two shortcuts at your own
pace.
